message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pmsimstats2025: N-of-1 Clinical Trial Simulation with Biomarker Interactions"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2025-01-28
authors:
  - family-names: "Hendrickson"
    given-names: "Rebecca C."
    email: "rebecca.hendrickson@va.gov"
    affiliation: "VA Puget Sound Health Care System"
  - family-names: "Thomas"
    given-names: "Ronald G."
    email: "rgthomas@ucsd.edu"
    affiliation: "University of California San Diego"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rgt47/pmsimstats2025"
license: GPL-3.0
keywords:
  - n-of-1 trials
  - clinical trials
  - biomarker
  - mixed-effects models
  - monte carlo simulation
  - carryover effects
  - precision medicine
abstract: >-
  Monte Carlo simulation framework for comparing N-of-1 clinical trial designs
  (Hybrid, Crossover, Open-Label, Parallel) with focus on statistical power
  when biomarker-treatment interactions and carryover effects are present.
  Based on Hendrickson et al. (2020) methodology with extensions for explicit
  biomarker moderation and carryover effect modeling.
